WEBVTT

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:14.290
So the Warehaus Wellness retreat, it's a full day event.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.290
We have yoga classes that are all levels flow

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.690
and this was paired with the ladyfingers duo.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.530
So it was live music, cover music with the ukulele.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.650
It's such a beautiful tone.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:31.420
All things go, all things grow, we add our...

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.580
And in the Warehaus, which is such a cool vibe.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.120
I mean, that's their brand, good vibes.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:40.700
And that's what you can see all around.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.340
We have the essential oils going, incense.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.820
We did some meditation.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.580
It was a really beautiful practice.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.500
It's a great event.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.340
I love doing it.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.780
I love holding space for people

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.860
and helping them move through the day.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.500
Bag with all of our local sponsors

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:08.770
so you can really enjoy the local feel.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.210
And yeah, there's a good vendor market afterwards

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:26.860
all about wellness and healing.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.460
Yeah, so I hope you come back.
